            "review_title": "Review at Click Clack: A Cafe and Lego Workshop",
            "review_text": "Huong H\n2 contributions\n0\nGood for friend hangout\nSep 2025 • Friends\nCome across this cafe when they open a few month back and have been going here regularly with friends. The location is convenience, close to Thao Dien main street, (easy to park a car) and in the weekday very quiet . Ideal if you want to find a place to do some remote work and hangout. I build Lego a few time but you don't have to if you just want to hang.\n\nDrink is good quality and fresh. Food is limited, mostly pastry and sandwich but overall filling and good for a light lunch. Comfortable and large table for you to spread out and the staff is really accommodating.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nWeekend can be pretty hectic with a lot of kids around\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 16, 2025\nFearless29567156430\nThanks so much for your kind review! We’re glad you and your friends enjoy hanging out here. We look forward to welcoming you back soon!\nWritten September 18, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
