            "review_title": "Review at Click Clack: A Cafe and Lego Workshop",
            "review_text": "The Lonely G\n1 contribution\n0\nSuper fun lego cafe in Saigon\nSep 2025 • Friends\nHad a super fun day at Click Clack! Delicious caramel frappucino. And you get to play lego too! Super chill afternoon having drink and building lego. The place is quite vibrant and cool. There are so many lego sets to choose from. The day pass is 200k and you get to play all the lego sets\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 11, 2025\nFearless29567156430\nWe’re so happy you had a fun day with us! Glad you enjoyed the caramel frappuccino and the LEGO play — hope to see you again for more builds soon\nRead more\nWritten September 18, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
